\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S2}{\ignorespaces We computed normalized difference indices between certain bands, hoping they would improve the land-cover classifiers. Depending on the satellite, we used different bands to compute similar indices. The function to compute a normalized difference between bands $b_1$ and $b_2$ is given by $\frac  {b1 - b2}{b1 + b2}$.}}{12}{table.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{ND}{{S2}{12}{We computed normalized difference indices between certain bands, hoping they would improve the land-cover classifiers. Depending on the satellite, we used different bands to compute similar indices. The function to compute a normalized difference between bands $b_1$ and $b_2$ is given by $\frac {b1 - b2}{b1 + b2}$}{table.caption.10}{}}
\newlabel{ND@cref}{{[table][2][2147483647]S2}{[1][12][]12}}
